OL,3,GNEWSAFacial recognition deployed in
OL,4,Atown for first time
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice will deploy facial recognition
OL,7,Ftechnology in Bournemouth for the first
OL,8,Ftime.
OL,10,FLive Facial Recognition (LFR) scans
OL,11,Ffaces in crowds and checks them against
OL,12,Fa watchlist of wanted people.
OL,14,FDorset Police, who will have cameras in
OL,15,Fplace near the pier on Wednesday
OL,16,Fmorning, said its watchlist would
OL,17,Finclude sex offenders, perpetrators of
OL,18,Fdomestic abuse, people subject to court
OL,19,Forders and missing people.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
