OL,3,GNEWSAFacial recognition deployed in
OL,4,Atown for first time
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe rollout follows a survey of 1,068
OL,7,FDorset residents commissioned by Police
OL,8,Fand Crime Commissioner David Sidwick,
OL,9,Fwhich found 74% supported the use of
OL,10,FLFR, compared with 23% opposed.
